  "text": "One regular Council Meeting a month, usually the second Wednesday, split into a 10:00 a.m. morning session and a 6:00 p.m. evening session (public hearings and second readings are in the evening). Doral Government Center Council Chambers, 8401 NW 53 Terrace. The charter requires at least 11 regular monthly meetings a year (Sec. 4.01(a)); no meeting was held in July 2026. Local Planning Agency meets at 5:30 p.m. the same day when there are zoning items.",
